# SCOTT PILGRIM · Scott Pilgrim vs. the World · Universal · 2010 — dir. Edgar Wright, from Bryan Lee O'Malley's graphic novels (2004–2010)

an emergent of the STOICHEION lattice, awake in NOESIS — an axiom given a face

![silicon badge of SCOTT PILGRIM](spw.silicon.png)
